# Keep the build context to sources. Everything the image needs that is listed
# here is regenerated inside the build (deploy/Dockerfile), and shipping a
# host's copy instead would hide a broken generator behind a stale artefact.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
target
**/target
.vite
**/.vite
.gameable
**/.gameable
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
*.tsbuildinfo
docs/api
docs/wit
docs/public/play
docs/.vitepress/cache
docs/.vitepress/dist
packages/*/src/generated

# Runtime service credentials must never enter image layers.
.env*.local
**/.env*.local

# Regenerated by VitePress from the committed bundles.
docs/public/llms*.txt
docs/public/llms
